      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I'm totally for this. Especially worlds, because of how difficult/time-consuming it can be to find a specific world (especially on VR), and the list keeps growing making it hard to find a world that you don't remember or can't spell/type the name of, for example if the world has symbols or foreign language.\n\nIt'd also be nice for world authors to have an option to enable/disable people favoriting their non-public world, as sometimes you just want a sort of \"Whitelist\" feature for people who can come/go as they please to that world even if you're offline.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
